  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oceans - Strengthening journalism&#x2019;s capacity to support environmental sustainability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A key objective of grant scheme / chapter post163.71 is to promote more sustainable management of ocean resources and better protection of marine ecosystems. The project will contribute to better understanding of the connection between the ocean&apos;s economic importance and its environmental condition, and support global efforts against illegal, unreported and unregulated fishing and fishing crime in developing countries.

This project has a global scope, addressing global challenges of organized cross-border crime affecting the environment. Regional hubs in Amazonas, Central Africa/Congo Basin and South Asia/Indonesia.</narrative>
  </description>
